<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CEN BANK SETS O/N REPO TENDER.</title>
<headline>CZECH CEN BANK SETS O/N REPO TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Monday it would hold an overnight repo tender to drain liquidity from the market, with yield to be determined from bids.</p>
</text>
